{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/95e669e585b1ff70777a29ed3e7550b0.avif?t=1772954402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras_big/95e669e585b1ff70777a29ed3e7550b0.avif?t=1772954402 width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mumagi: Stellar Saviors </i></strong>is a co-op horde survivor where you can gather up to 4 players to take down celestial forces. Choose a magical girl, enhance your powers, and restore time and space to their natural order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/f22e9bd571564d763a3579be3b2fe0aa.avif?t=1772954402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras_big/f22e9bd571564d763a3579be3b2fe0aa.webp?t=1772954402 width=1560 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat hordes of enemies, level up, and upgrade your magical girl. Choose powers that fit your unique playstyle, and take advantage of your magical girl's signature move. When you add friends to the mix, you can uncover new multiplayer powers that allow you to coordinate with your allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/b9f26a8369e7f5b944e80e3c1b93f6a8.poster.avif?t=1772954402\" width=502 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/b9f26a8369e7f5b944e80e3c1b93f6a8.webm?t=1772954402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/b9f26a8369e7f5b944e80e3c1b93f6a8.mp4?t=1772954402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer-exclusive abilities that encourage coordination between allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique magical girls with their own ultimates, signatures, and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages with unique terrain obstacles and celestial bosses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689240?t=1772954402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689240?t=1772954402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/f9934527854841c72297c3ca41ee08e994bf7e9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772954402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/f9934527854841c72297c3ca41ee08e994bf7e9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772954402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3782600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"