0/extras/b9f26a8369e7f5b944e80e3c1b93f6a8.mp4?t=1772954402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer-exclusive abilities that encourage coordination between allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique magical girls with their own ultimates, signatures, and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages with unique terrain obstacles and celestial bosses</p></li></ul>","developers":["Saffrona","Qwerty"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/1425c1523b12894dca8b009ea87fd7d69e36fc75/header.jpg?t=1772954402","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3689240/9411129/a4aa269c886becec6a703d4ab19ec6a6461790fa/1772951677/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772954400","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3689240/9411129/a4aa269c886becec6a703d4ab19ec6a6461790fa/1772951677/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772954400","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3689240/9411129/a4aa269c886becec6a703d4ab19ec6a6461790fa/1772951677/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772954400","id":257299678,"name":"Mumagi: Stellar Saviors - 2026 Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https